    "headline": "LH Q2 Deep Dive: Specialty Testing and Consumer Growth Drive Guidance Increase",
    "summary": "Healthcare diagnostics company Labcorp Holdings (NYSE:LH) met Wall Street’s revenue expectations in Q2 CY2026, with sales up 5.8% year on year to $3.73 billion. The company’s outlook for the full year was close to analysts’ estimates with revenue guided to $14.77 billion at the midpoint. Its non-GAAP profit of $4.99 per share was 4.6% above analysts’ consensus estimates.",
